{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes content about 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions). Many candidates have \"市场观察\" (market observation) content type which describes restaurant chain locations, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, and kitchen appliance discounts - these directly conflict with the interest's exclusion.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists concepts, provides question directory\n- 操作记录 (operation record) - reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, heating times\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, structure affect texture\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - describes local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - restaurant operations, kitchen appliance promotions\n\nThe interest says: 关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理 (reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles), 不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销 (not interested in restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promotions).\n\nSo the \"市场观察\" content type directly conflicts with the exclusion. These should be excluded.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" content type is about local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories - this is somewhat tangential to the interest's focus on reproducible methods and cooking principles. It's not directly about cooking methods/principles. It's more cultural/historical. This is less aligned with the core interest.\n\nThe best matches are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing order, heating times - directly matches \"可复现做法\"\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains moisture, temperature, structure effects - directly matches \"烹饪原理\"\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists concepts, provides question directory - somewhat relevant as an entry point\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20 from the 80 exposed.\n\nLet me identify the market observation ones to exclude (they conflict with explicit exclusion):\n- item-18affaa8aa1e 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-1c455877dcbb 蒸鱼：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-20be4b3109e6 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-29a2ceb5a219 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-2bc251faf37d 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-2dd514471f2d 煎豆腐：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-30ba6b1bdace 面团发酵：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-31ef127a8f01 番茄炒蛋：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-3b75b14db3a2 米饭含水量：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-3ccd8e917ed5 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-45153d453613 鸡胸肉口感：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-48f6b3f401da 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-494354763cad 面团发酵：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-510ecf76ae65 蔬菜焯水：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-51661c044642 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的市场观察\n- item-5499ab1667d3 面团发酵：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-5752095dcba2 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的市场观察\n\nThese market observation items should be excluded because they directly conflict with the explicit interest exclusion of 餐饮门店经营 or 厨电促销.\n\nNow, the 专题观察 items describe local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories. These are not about reproducible methods or cooking principles. They're cultural content. Given the interest focuses on 可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理, these 专题观察 items are less aligned. However, they're not explicitly excluded. But given the interest is quite focused on practical cooking, I should prioritize 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览.\n\nLet me count available candidates that are NOT market observation. There are 80 exposed. Let me count the market observation ones I found: 17. So 63 non-market candidates.\n\nI need to select 20. Let me prioritize the ones most aligned with the interest: 操作记录 (reproducible methods), 条件与原理 (cooking principles), and 概念速览 (concept overviews as entry points).\n\nLet me count the types among the candidates. Let me look at the full list of candidates and categorize.\n\nGiven the large number, let me focus on selecting a balanced set across dishes and content types that align with the interest.\n\nThe dishes/topics present: 煎豆腐, 煎饺, 米饭含水量, 清汤调味, 蒸鱼, 番茄炒蛋, 鸡胸肉口感, 面团发酵, 蔬菜焯水, 炖牛肉.\n\nContent types aligned with interest: 操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览. The 专题观察 (cultural/historical) is less aligned but not excluded.\n\nLet me select 20 candidates prioritizing 操作记录 and 条件与原理 (most aligned with reproducible methods and cooking principles), plus some 概念速览 for entry points, balanced across dishes.\n\nLet me identify the 操作记录 candidates:\n- item-024e99402549 煎饺：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-4736b753745c 煎饺：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-58677ff38120 面团发酵：小份试做中的操作记录\n\n条件与原理 candidates:\n- item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n- item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-20168695fc11 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-3302498cd23d 煎饺：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-33a0f6fe41f5 蒸鱼：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-34eb4892cc8d 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-39131d1ff5ce 清汤调味：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-508ee443dfc5 煎饺：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-5adc97f63de0 煎豆腐：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n- item-5b3fc88bc33f 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n\n概念速览 candidates (many). \n\nGiven the interest strongly emphasizes reproducible methods and cooking principles, I'll build a collection of 20 that prioritizes 操作记录 and 条件与原理, and includes some 概念速览 for entry points, balanced across dishes.\n\nLet me select a balanced set. I'll aim for diversity across the dishes/topics.\n\nLet me pick 20. I'll prioritize the operation records and conditions/principles which are most aligned.\n\nLet me select across dishes to ensure balance. Dishes: 煎豆腐, 煎饺, 米饭含水量, 清汤调味, 蒸鱼, 番茄炒蛋, 鸡胸肉口感, 面团发酵, 蔬菜焯水, 炖牛肉.\n\nI'll choose a mix. Let me select these 20:\n\n1. item-024e99402549 煎饺：工作日备餐中的操作记录 (operation record - reproducible)\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n4. item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n6. item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n7. item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n8. item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n9. item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n10. item-4736b753745c 煎饺：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n11. item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n12. item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n13. item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n14. item-58677ff38120 面团发酵：小份试做中的操作记录\n15. item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n16. item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n17. item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的条件与原理\n18. item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的条件与原理\n19. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n20. item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n\nHmm, this is heavily weighted toward operation records. Let me reconsider balance. Actually, given the interest explicitly focuses on 可复现做法 (reproducible methods) and 烹饪原理 (cooking principles), operation records and conditions/principles are the two most aligned types. But I should also include some 概念速览 as entry points for variety and to balance across content types.\n\nLet me reconsider. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" All candidates are from the same source (Open Web) and same interest. So balance across content types matters.\n\nContent types aligned: 操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览. The 专题观察 is cultural/historical and less aligned with the practical cooking focus.\n\nLet me build a balanced collection of 20